WEBVTT

00:08:59.910 --> 00:09:01.579
A better kind of spiral.

00:09:02.746 --> 00:09:05.249
From that point on,
if you put a ball in my hands,

00:09:05.291 --> 00:09:06.542
I felt stronger.

00:09:07.001 --> 00:09:08.961
I did my exercises better.

00:09:09.336 --> 00:09:11.797
I can't explain it, but I felt lighter.

00:09:11.839 --> 00:09:13.507
I felt alive.

00:09:14.758 --> 00:09:16.594
After that first visit,

00:09:16.635 --> 00:09:19.013
I felt like I had permission
to dream again.

00:09:19.847 --> 00:09:22.224
I thought about getting back
out onto the field.

00:09:23.100 --> 00:09:24.935
If I make it back, great,

00:09:24.935 --> 00:09:27.021
if I don't, who cares,

00:09:27.062 --> 00:09:29.023
at least I was living for something.

00:09:29.815 --> 00:09:33.152
And that's the mentality
that carried me through my recovery.